WEBVTT

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:35.740
Thank you.

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:30.200
Thank you.

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:33.760
So, Alon, answer, I'm here, who's there?

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:39.730
I don't know, I'm always here, I'm always there.

00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:44.780
How are you? I missed you, how are you?

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.570
I'm Mario del Carmen.

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:19.630
Have you forgotten me? Since you didn't call me, I have many things to tell you. Will you come?

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:25.760
Well, I'm going there right away. See you later.

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:41.460
And what do you think?

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:50.980
To tell you the truth, they wouldn't take long to find out.

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:03.340
There's a lot of people downstairs.

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:05.050
Oh, you're right.

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:29.690
One hundred! One hundred! One hundred!

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:31.400
Let's see who's going to raise this offer.

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:34.560
You have to give him a little more, gentlemen.

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:36.300
One hundred and twenty.

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:39.190
One hundred and twenty pesos for a thousand-dollar wedding

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:40.910
that only his arms are missing.

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:44.120
One hundred and twenty. One hundred and twenty.

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:45.490
How much?

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:47.130
One hundred and fifty.

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:49.900
One hundred and fifty. One hundred and fifty.

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.230
One hundred and fifty.

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:53.410
Isn't there anyone else?

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:59.010
One hundred and fifty, and he's gone.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.980
Comrade, the handkerchief is yours.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:12.100
Padrino, will you also take my toys?

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:18.220
No, dear, your toys no.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:27.720
And now, ladies and gentlemen, I will close the library.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.520
How much is this well-equipped Martín Fierro?

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.330
How much is it worth? How much is this Martín Fierro worth?

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:37.420
Ten pesos.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.560
Ten pesos? Ten pesos?

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:43.450
Ten, ten, ten, ten...

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:47.800
Not this one. It still belongs to me.

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:59.520
I'm sorry, ma'am. My father gave it to me when...

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:03.720
How much do you want to take advantage of us?

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:06.450
Now, let's go and see if we can get a smaller but brighter box.

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:08.040
Then we'll see the next ones.

00:07:34.284 --> 00:07:35.284
Good afternoon!

00:07:35.596 --> 00:07:37.596
Mr. Madrugador...

00:07:37.644 --> 00:07:40.804
Because you were the one who was going to call me at noon, weren't you?

00:07:40.804 --> 00:07:42.184
Forgive me, María del Carmen.

00:07:43.052 --> 00:07:45.052
Naturally.

00:07:45.356 --> 00:07:47.156
The gentleman is very busy.

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:49.620
Thank you.

00:07:50.092 --> 00:07:52.092
It's been a long day talking about everything.

00:07:52.364 --> 00:07:54.364
You know who came to see me?

00:07:54.892 --> 00:07:55.392
Thank you.

00:07:58.668 --> 00:07:59.168
Bye!

00:08:00.550 --> 00:08:07.200
Maria del Carmen, I can't, I shouldn't keep missing.

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:15.430
Do you remember her?

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:21.100
It's not like her, she's never been as sincere as she is today.

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:25.060
I don't understand you.

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:29.960
I've always lacked the courage to talk to you.

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:34.130
Today the circumstances force me to move away from this house.

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:39.610
A woman.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:47.240
The game, the game that has taken everything from me,

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:50.400
to the happiness of being with you.

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:51.980
Feliz.

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:54.720
When I met you, it was late.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:57.380
The economic situation collapsed.

00:08:57.960 --> 00:08:59.980
I hid it, believing that...

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:10.880
that for your love would save me and a coward that I have nothing left, my love, now more than

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:22.080
ever I will be by your side, your love is my rest and I do not want to lose it, I must retire, but you have thought about it

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:28.560
well, I am leaving to become worthy of you, what took away from me the game will be returned to me by work

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:31.770
I'm going to fight to deserve it.

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:49.060
De Luis, Don Pablo.

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:03.300
What's going on?

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:07.640
I'm going to the police.

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:15.620
Wait for me at my desk.

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:17.260
I'll be with you.

00:11:32.236 --> 00:11:32.736
Carlos

00:11:32.908 --> 00:11:36.208
What do you think we leave this matter of advertising for another time?

00:11:38.604 --> 00:11:39.604
I will thank you.

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:41.960
I'm sorry to have bothered you.

00:11:42.508 --> 00:11:43.908
Please, Mr. Pablo.

00:11:44.716 --> 00:11:45.716
There will be time.

00:11:55.628 --> 00:11:56.628
Don't call me Ramirez.

00:11:57.324 --> 00:11:59.564
You know José Luis very well.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:03.940
As a result, he met his parents, his family.

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:05.940
Did he know them, player?

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:11.390
Money.

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:14.510
When he inherited from his parents, he went to Europe.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.230
He was about seven years old.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:19.500
He returned more or less to the year as a result of the death of a sister.

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:22.980
The only sister he had, a player in Pedernillo.

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:25.570
The whole Buenas Aires Nocturno knew his walk.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:29.180
I tried on many occasions to make him change his behavior.

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:35.800
But this current situation seems to have lost it all.

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.750
I've known this current situation for a long time.

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:41.620
Being my friend, you must warn me.

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:43.150
I couldn't speak.

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:46.500
Do you know my interest in María del Carmen?

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:49.540
Who knows how she would have interpreted my words.

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:15.180
I don't know, Tita. I mean, I'm still playing with your daughter.

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:19.170
You're not my daughter. I want to play with you.

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:21.210
You're the best, Tita.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.500
Oh, you're the best, Tita.

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:34.800
Mrs. Celista, I know you are a great woman.

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:36.560
Why don't you believe me?

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:39.020
Really, you are very good.

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:42.180
More than good, she was a saint.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:53.660
You are a great woman.

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:56.030
Go, please, look what happened in the kitchen.

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:58.470
Despite everything, you are great.

00:13:58.930 --> 00:13:59.790
You are very good.

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:01.250
Because it's the only thing that matters to me, right?

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:19.160
Yeah, it's always good for me.

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:23.780
Are you going to lie to me?

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:26.570
No, I'm not going to lie to you.

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:02.830
Ma'am, I'd like to speak to Mr. Ramirez.

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:06.140
He's busy now. Please sit down and wait a moment.

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:07.150
Thank you.

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:17.100
Who should I call, ma'am?

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:22.240
Tell him she's an old friend of mine.

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:23.980
All right.

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:32.740
Indeed, I have a lot to tell you.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:33.040
Well?

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:37.340
Well, and about the other thing...

00:15:37.340 --> 00:15:38.060
But when did you arrive?

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:41.650
A few days ago, and now I'm visiting my good friends.

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:46.000
So, it must have been to see José Luis.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.160
Lizard! Lizard!

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:50.620
I'll never lose to him what he did to me in Paris,

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:52.940
when he left me planted, nothing more, nothing less.

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:57.770
Although it seems that destiny took care of paying for them.

00:15:57.810 --> 00:15:59.940
I've found out that they are...

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:04.090
But let's not talk about the paper. Let's talk about us.

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:05.110
As you wish.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:07.290
First of all, I warn you that this visit is interesting.

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:09.870
Fine, I can be useful to you.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:11.640
I need a good contract.

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:13.590
And given your experience in advertising,

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:16.930
it seemed to me that no one has indicated me more than you to get it for me.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:20.420
But I warn you that I need a lot of money.

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:24.590
I think I can please you.

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:03.010
Thank you.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:33.370
They talked to Pepe for a long time. They talked about you.

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:34.470
Poor thing.

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:40.400
Well, tomorrow at the same time we'll see each other here like every other day.

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:43.430
But you know what you promised me, eh?

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:45.310
Not a word to anyone.

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:47.360
Not to José Luis?

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:48.500
Not to José Luis.

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:50.100
See you tomorrow then.

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:50.960
See you tomorrow.

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:11.500
What is this?

00:18:12.470 --> 00:18:15.400
The dialogical little watercolors I'm writing.

00:18:16.230 --> 00:18:17.070
A popular little thing.

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:19.670
But they're yours!

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:22.160
Yes, thank you very much!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:23.740
But they really are yours!

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:25.540
If you don't mind...

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.330
I don't mind.

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:28.310
I have the occasion to give you a little hand.

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:32.480
What are you going to do?

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:35.460
This is a close-up.

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:37.710
I had to do something big for you.

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:40.730
I'll send you the news.

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:43.400
But hey, man!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:00.200
You

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:30.700
You

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:18.220
I'm the director here.

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:21.020
May I, please?

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:21.830
Yes, of course.

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:42.580
Just a moment, sir, they'll take care of it.

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:43.400
But I told you it was urgent.

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:44.180
Yes, sir.

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:45.260
Do me a favor.

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:45.880
This one.

00:20:45.980 --> 00:20:49.540
How funny.

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:15.360
Mr. Puentes, what do you want, sir?

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:17.130
Are you the artistic director?

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:21.000
I am the secretary.

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:23.200
Nice to meet you.

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:28.650
Well, sir, let's make it clear. What do you want?

00:21:29.190 --> 00:21:29.910
That, I mean...

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:35.460
I'm here to bring you 50,000 new listeners and I want to talk to the director.

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:38.290
It's not possible. The director is very busy.

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:40.490
Leave your name and address and he'll let you know.

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:43.130
Take care of yourself.

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:48.130
Oh, no. Not to keep you waiting.

00:21:48.790 --> 00:21:50.600
She's the only one I have.

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:59.600
All right, sir.

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:00.970
He'll be here soon.

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:03.930
Well, but due to the doubts...

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:07.320
...or if the address is lost...

00:22:07.320 --> 00:22:09.150
...I'll be back tomorrow.

00:22:09.370 --> 00:22:27.830
Good afternoon, miss.

00:22:28.110 --> 00:22:29.650
How are you, Mr. Ramírez?

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:30.980
At this very moment, I'm delighted.

00:22:31.380 --> 00:22:32.450
Are you going for a walk?

00:22:33.020 --> 00:22:34.640
Yes, Dad. I have some friends.

00:22:34.940 --> 00:22:37.320
If you allow me, I'll put my car at your disposal.

00:22:37.760 --> 00:22:39.160
Very kind. I accept.

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:40.680
See you later, Dad.

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:42.110
See you tomorrow, Don Pablo.

00:22:42.330 --> 00:22:42.930
See you tomorrow.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:03.360
Every time I see her, I can't help but remember the day I met her.

00:23:03.380 --> 00:23:08.860
She was almost a girl. Time has gone by so fast.

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:13.690
She's not here anymore, my eyes don't see her as they knew her,

00:23:13.790 --> 00:23:15.370
nor do my feelings.

00:23:16.030 --> 00:23:20.640
Mr. Ramirez, you always say you're my father's friend,

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:22.280
and that's how I've treated him.

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:26.670
I admit it. However, I must tell you something that I can't keep hiding.

00:23:27.160 --> 00:23:28.700
I don't trust you at all.

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:32.020
Is it possible that I don't like to hear it?

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:34.480
Neither to me, shut up. I can't or I don't want to.

00:23:35.130 --> 00:23:39.800
Besides, I remind you that despite everything, I'm still José Luis' girlfriend.

00:23:40.040 --> 00:23:46.050
Forgive me. Absurd fate. José Luis left and you're waiting for him.

00:23:46.190 --> 00:23:52.190
He moved away from my house, but not from my thoughts. I know I'm going.

00:23:52.310 --> 00:23:56.700
I guess Luisa, love grows in love.

00:23:58.510 --> 00:23:58.710
Fine.

00:24:00.320 --> 00:24:05.640
This conversation gives you a signal, as you will continue to wait.

00:24:30.030 --> 00:24:31.170
See you later, ma'am.

00:25:49.708 --> 00:25:50.088
No, no, no, no, no.

00:26:29.600 --> 00:26:29.940
RUN!

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:32.720
Look, what a miracle that you remember me.

00:26:33.000 --> 00:26:36.430
I need to talk to you. Can you dine with me tonight?

00:26:37.060 --> 00:26:39.490
Of course. It's for some contract.

00:26:40.300 --> 00:26:41.720
It's much more important.

00:26:42.680 --> 00:26:43.380
There's a lot of money.

00:26:44.570 --> 00:26:45.610
The one you want.

00:26:46.090 --> 00:26:59.430
Ma'am, a lady would like to talk to you or to the gentleman.

00:27:00.480 --> 00:27:03.030
A lady? You don't know her?

00:27:03.300 --> 00:27:05.250
No, miss. She's never been here.

00:27:05.650 --> 00:27:07.320
I don't know who she could be.

00:27:07.780 --> 00:27:10.140
She says it's something of great interest to her.

00:27:10.750 --> 00:27:12.230
Make her come and visit my father.

00:27:35.210 --> 00:27:37.120
Mrs. María del Carmen?

00:27:37.860 --> 00:27:38.680
Yes, ma'am.

00:27:38.700 --> 00:27:41.270
Forgive me for this apprehension.

00:27:41.630 --> 00:27:49.290
Ma'am, I don't understand.

00:27:49.730 --> 00:27:52.330
It's been hard for me to decide to take this step.

00:27:52.670 --> 00:27:54.420
What's your problem?

00:27:55.260 --> 00:27:56.240
Speak, ma'am.

00:27:56.240 --> 00:27:57.490
Yes, ma'am.

00:28:00.030 --> 00:28:02.410
I've been Jose Grillo's lover.

00:28:02.410 --> 00:28:18.450
Are you one of the others?

00:28:18.610 --> 00:28:22.900
I spent a lot of time in San Pedro.

00:28:23.080 --> 00:28:24.640
I recently came back.

00:28:24.800 --> 00:28:26.630
I looked for him at night and he was everywhere.

00:28:27.390 --> 00:28:29.970
Then I found out that he was...

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:38.750
He says he wants her. I just came to ask him to intercede so he can give me back my daughter.

00:28:38.990 --> 00:28:40.640
How did he say?

00:28:40.860 --> 00:28:46.270
La Porotita. That girl who makes him go through Elzada is our daughter.

00:28:46.710 --> 00:28:50.790
She was born in Paris. When he abandoned me, he brought her with him.

00:28:51.980 --> 00:28:56.090
Since then, I have fought to return to the country and recover her.

00:29:00.570 --> 00:29:03.540
Sir, José Luis has retired from the office.

00:29:03.900 --> 00:29:07.990
As always, we know nothing and we don't want to know anything about him.

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:00.420
What's going on?

00:30:00.540 --> 00:30:02.060
It can't happen, sir.

00:30:02.180 --> 00:30:02.400
How?

00:30:04.170 --> 00:30:04.970
It has to be clarified.

00:30:05.430 --> 00:30:06.670
It's clear, clear.

00:30:07.110 --> 00:30:10.480
I have an order not to let it happen, and I agree.

00:30:11.570 --> 00:30:12.550
But I need to see the director.

00:30:13.060 --> 00:30:15.660
He's been saying the same thing to me for 15 days.

00:30:15.720 --> 00:30:17.120
This proves that I'm not lying.

00:30:17.520 --> 00:30:20.450
Come on, old man.

00:30:21.240 --> 00:30:21.800
You're the best.

00:30:23.380 --> 00:30:24.840
Don't work on me.

00:30:25.080 --> 00:30:25.560
You.

00:30:26.200 --> 00:30:26.880
Don't pass.

00:30:27.350 --> 00:30:28.090
But you, King Kong!

00:30:28.290 --> 00:30:28.470
Enough!

00:30:32.680 --> 00:30:33.260
It's all right.

00:31:00.252 --> 00:31:02.252
You

00:31:32.560 --> 00:31:35.770
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:00.960
Ah, how are you?

00:32:01.560 --> 00:32:03.180
It seems that we are all, isn't it?

00:32:03.180 --> 00:32:04.700
One, two, three, four, five...

00:32:04.700 --> 00:32:07.030
Yes, we are all.

00:32:07.510 --> 00:32:16.040
If you do me a favor, give my card to the artistic director.

00:32:16.180 --> 00:32:19.640
No problem.

00:32:20.780 --> 00:32:23.630
Ah, and give it back to me.

00:32:31.210 --> 00:32:31.510
Thank you.

00:33:06.200 --> 00:33:09.180
You can talk to the artistic director.

00:33:09.200 --> 00:33:09.440
What?

00:33:11.320 --> 00:33:14.240
You can talk to the artistic director.

00:33:14.930 --> 00:33:16.530
I'm the secretary, what do you want?

00:33:18.210 --> 00:33:19.430
I'm not a thief, you know?

00:33:19.710 --> 00:33:22.280
And I came to talk to him, in case he wants to do a test.

00:33:22.540 --> 00:33:23.540
Do it?

00:33:24.000 --> 00:33:26.240
Well, look, it's in that room, see?

00:33:28.280 --> 00:33:28.960
It's the other room.

00:33:32.080 --> 00:33:32.620
Thank you.

00:33:32.640 --> 00:33:34.860
You deserve it and you don't take it away from me.

00:34:12.410 --> 00:34:13.070
But?

00:34:13.460 --> 00:34:15.950
But how could he have come in?

00:34:16.200 --> 00:34:18.740
We have to clarify. I think that people come in through the door.

00:34:21.990 --> 00:34:24.990
